  {
   "id": 506193,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "In a geometric sequence, the first term is 10 and the common ratio is 1.5. What is the 15th term?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The <i>n</i>th term of a geometric sequence, <span data-math=\"{a_n}\"></span>, with first term <span data-math=\"{a_1}\"></span> and common ratio <i>r</i>, is <span data-math=\"{a_n} = {a_1}{r^{n - 1}}\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{a_{15}} = 10{\\left( {1.5} \\right)^{14}} \\approx 2,919.293\"></span> (rounded to three decimal places)</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "2,919.293 (rounded off to three decimal places)"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
